cpptest
------------------------------------------
Powerful, yet simple, C++ unit testing framework

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libcpptest-devel-2.0.1-1bl1
  libcpptest1-2.0.1-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.7-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  autoconf-archive-2024.10.16-1
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/cpptest/cpptest

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/cpptest/cpptest/archive/refs/tags/2.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack cpptest-2.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./cpptest-2.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/cpptest-2.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/cpptest-2.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcpptest1-2.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcpptest-devel-2.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(cpptest)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/cpptest.README
  /usr/share/doc/cpptest/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/cpptest/BUGS
